1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,590
Welcome to Voltura Air.

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:08,659
In this guide, we'll connect your phone to your
Windows PC and try the trackpad and keyboard.

3
00:00:08,659 --> 00:00:12,255
You don't need a mobile app or a Voltura
account.

4
00:00:13,133 --> 00:00:18,303
On your Windows 11 PC, visit voltura.se/air.

5
00:00:18,303 --> 00:00:22,002
Follow the download link and choose the full
installer.

6
00:00:22,002 --> 00:00:25,623
It includes the required .NET runtimes.

7
00:00:25,623 --> 00:00:28,973
You'll need a 64-bit Windows PC.

8
00:00:29,867 --> 00:00:35,050
Run the installer, follow its setup prompts,
then open Voltura Air.

9
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:38,233
Phone Webcam is an optional component.

10
00:00:38,233 --> 00:00:42,138
You don't need it for this trackpad and
keyboard walkthrough.

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,268
Connect your phone and PC to the same private
home network.

12
00:00:47,268 --> 00:00:50,670
Your PC can use Ethernet or Wi-Fi.

13
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:53,995
Direct LAN is the default connection mode.

14
00:00:53,995 --> 00:00:57,294
On the PC, open the Connect page.

15
00:00:58,167 --> 00:01:04,768
Use your phone's camera to scan the QR code
shown on your own PC, then open the detected
link.

16
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,667
The controller opens in your browser.

17
00:01:07,667 --> 00:01:11,069
The code in this video is only an example.

18
00:01:11,069 --> 00:01:14,097
Always scan your own PC's code.

19
00:01:14,967 --> 00:01:18,887
Once connected, keep Touch selected on the
trackpad.

20
00:01:18,887 --> 00:01:22,470
Slide one finger to move the PC's pointer.

21
00:01:22,470 --> 00:01:26,194
Tap to click, or use the Left and Right
buttons.

22
00:01:26,194 --> 00:01:28,797
Drag two fingers to scroll.

23
00:01:29,667 --> 00:01:36,268
Click a text field on your PC, then choose
Keyboard on the controller and try a short line
of text.

24
00:01:36,268 --> 00:01:41,461
On a wide tablet, the keyboard and trackpad can
sit side by side.

25
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:44,217
You're ready to go.

26
00:01:44,217 --> 00:01:49,269
Manage trusted devices and their permissions
from Devices on the PC.

27
00:01:49,269 --> 00:01:54,501
If pairing fails, check that both devices are
on the same private network.

28
00:01:54,501 --> 00:02:00,184
Find help, downloads, and more features at
voltura.se/air.
